    "detailed_description": "The world as you know it no longer exists: black clouds hover over the planet, strange shadows lurk everywhere.<br>The only solution? Explore the lost continent.<br><br>In this FPS metroidvania, you need to master the art of bubbles.<br>Shoot bubbles on elemental foes, use the best element to deal maximum damage.<br>Unlock platforming abilities used by shooting lasers at your bubbles allowing you to reach unreachable places.<br>For example:<br>Earth bubbles allow you to create platforms:<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507670/extras/1a722289c435e641be500938400feee9.poster.avif?t=1697199832\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507670/extras/1a722289c435e641be500938400feee9.webm?t=1697199832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507670/extras/1a722289c435e641be500938400feee9.mp4?t=1697199832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Water bubbles make you jump higher:<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507670/extras/6a61d79ad19106b2b45f9b5a60f4f4d2.poster.avif?t=1697199832\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507670/extras/6a61d79ad19106b2b45f9b5a60f4f4d2.webm?t=1697199832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507670/extras/6a61d79ad19106b2b45f9b5a60f4f4d2.mp4?t=1697199832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Wind bubbles make you jump further:<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507670/extras/0f5681af729846d2a0778f9cb9201902.poster.avif?t=1697199832\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507670/extras/0f5681af729846d2a0778f9cb9201902.webm?t=1697199832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507670/extras/0f5681af729846d2a0778f9cb9201902.mp4?t=1697199832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Use these at your advantage during fight. Or simply craft and use powerful potions.<br><br>To progress in you exploration you also need to solve bubble physics based puzzles.<br><br>Put the pieces together to find the cause of the blight and a way to cure it!",
    "about_the_game": "The world as you know it no longer exists: black clouds hover over the planet, strange shadows lurk everywhere.<br>The only solution? Explore the lost continent.<br><br>In this FPS metroidvania, you need to master the art of bubbles.<br>Shoot bubbles on elemental foes, use the best element to deal maximum damage.<br>Unlock platforming abilities used by shooting lasers at your bubbles allowing you to reach unreachable places.<br>For example:<br>Earth bubbles allow you to create platforms:<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507670/extras/1a722289c435e641be500938400feee9.poster.avif?t=1697199832\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507670/extras/1a722289c435e641be500938400feee9.webm?t=1697199832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507670/extras/1a722289c435e641be500938400feee9.mp4?t=1697199832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Water bubbles make you jump higher:<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507670/extras/6a61d79ad19106b2b45f9b5a60f4f4d2.poster.avif?t=1697199832\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507670/extras/6a61d79ad19106b2b45f9b5a60f4f4d2.webm?t=1697199832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507670/extras/6a61d79ad19106b2b45f9b5a60f4f4d2.mp4?t=1697199832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Wind bubbles make you jump further:<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507670/extras/0f5681af729846d2a0778f9cb9201902.poster.avif?t=1697199832\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507670/extras/0f5681af729846d2a0778f9cb9201902.webm?t=1697199832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507670/extras/0f5681af729846d2a0778f9cb9201902.mp4?t=1697199832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Use these at your advantage during fight. Or simply craft and use powerful potions.<br><br>To progress in you exploration you also need to solve bubble physics based puzzles.<br><br>Put the pieces together to find the cause of the blight and a way to cure it!",
